# Node version

- **Before any npm, npx, or node command**, run: `nvm use`
- The project uses the version in `.nvmrc` (e.g. v24.19.0). Do not run `npm install`, `npx prisma generate`, `npm run build`, etc. without first running `nvm use`.
- In scripts and CI, use `nvm use` (or ensure the correct Node version is active) before invoking npm/npx.
